  "id": "entendendoDNS",
  "title": "Configuração via DNS (Método Gatilho)",
  "parent": "duvidasMetodosExtras",
  "description": "O guia definitivo sobre como o DNS transforma apps comuns em gatilhos para o nosso servidor.",
  "content": {
    "type": "text",
    "data": "<div class='space-y-10'><div class='bg-blue-600/10 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-8'><p class='text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-lightbulb'></i> O que é o DNS?</p><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1'>O DNS funciona como um 'GPS' para a sua TV. Ele direciona a conexão de aplicativos parceiros (gatilhos) diretamente para o nosso servidor TOPTV.</p></div><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>1</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Endereços Oficiais</h4><div class='grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4'><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-blue-500/30 p-5 rounded-3xl text-center shadow-xl'><p class='text-[8px] font-black text-blue-400 uppercase mb-1'>DNS Primário</p><h2 class='text-xl font-black text-white tracking-tighter'>45.139.122.240</h2></div><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 p-5 rounded-3xl text-center shadow-xl'><p class='text-[8px] font-black text-gray-500 uppercase mb-1'>DNS Secundário</p><h2 class='text-xl font-black text-white/50 tracking-tighter'>104.238.205.29</h2></div></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>2</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Apps Compatíveis (Gatilhos)</h4><p class='text-sm text-gray-400 mb-4'>Após configurar o DNS na sua TV, basta abrir um destes apps:</p><div class='grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2'><div class='bg-[#0d1117] border border-gray-800 p-3 rounded-xl text-center text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-300 uppercase'>Smartup</div><div class='bg-[#0d1117] border border-gray-800 p-3 rounded-xl text-center text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-300 uppercase'>SmartOne</div><div class='bg-[#0d1117] border border-gray-800 p-3 rounded-xl text-center text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-300 uppercase'>Looke</div><div class='bg-[#0d1117] border border-gray-800 p-3 rounded-xl text-center text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-300 uppercase'>SSIPTV</div><div class='bg-[#0d1117] border border-gray-800 p-3 rounded-xl text-center text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-300 uppercase'>Sweet TV</div><div class='bg-[#0d1117] border border-gray-800 p-3 rounded-xl text-center text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-300 uppercase'>Portal IPTV</div></div></section></div>"
  }
}
